:name: STM32H743 (bare chip)
:description: rtoos firmware on an STM32H743xI, console USART3. Set $bin to the ELF to run.

$name?="stm32h743"
$bin?=@build/arm-h743/apps/stm32h743/h743_selftest.elf

using sysbus
mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/stm32h743.repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu VectorTableOffset 0x08000000
"""
runMacro $reset
